description:
Spent some time with the Trinity River Audubon Center folks in setting up a iNat project.  It's off to a great start!  :)  After the meeting, I spent some time walking around the grounds for a bit.  

I'm not sure about this tree -- need to work on it some more...

@jim-botany -- any ideas?

observation in the spring:  https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/1299569;
observation showing tree with fruit:  https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/2476492.
observation showing fall foliage:  https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/2447340.
